graph TD
    %% Amino Acid Depletion
    A[Amino Acid Starvation] --> B{OR: Which AA<br/>Depleted?}
    B -->|Histidine| C[His-tRNA Uncharged]
    B -->|Tryptophan| D[Trp-tRNA Uncharged]
    B -->|Leucine| E[Leu-tRNA Uncharged]
    B -->|Other| F[General AA Depletion]
    
    C --> G[Uncharged tRNA Accumulation]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G
    
    %% Gcn2 Activation
    G --> H[Gcn2 Kinase Sensing]
    H --> I[Gcn2 HisRS-like Domain]
    I --> J[Uncharged tRNA Binding]
    J --> K[Gcn2 Dimerization]
    K --> L[Gcn2 Trans-autophosphorylation]
    L --> M[Gcn2 Active]
    
    %% eIF2α Phosphorylation
    M --> N[eIF2α Substrate]
    N --> O[Gcn2 Phosphorylates eIF2α-Ser51]
    O --> P[eIF2α-P Formation]
    
    %% eIF2B Sequestration
    P --> Q{AND: eIF2α-P<br/>Binds eIF2B?}
    Q -->|No| R[Normal Translation]
    Q -->|Yes| S[eIF2B Sequestered]
    
    S --> T[/eIF2-GTP Regeneration Blocked/]
    T --> U[Reduced TC Formation]
    U --> V[Global Translation Reduced]
    
    %% GCN4 mRNA Structure
    W[GCN4 mRNA] --> X[Long 5' UTR]
    X --> Y[4 Upstream ORFs uORF1-4]
    Y --> Z[uORF1 - Short]
    Y --> AA[uORF2 - Short]
    Y --> AB[uORF3 - Short]
    Y --> AC[uORF4 - Overlaps GCN4]
    
    %% Normal Conditions Translation
    R --> AD[High TC Availability]
    AD --> AE[40S Scans from Cap]
    AE --> AF[Initiates at uORF1]
    AF --> AG[Translates uORF1]
    AG --> AH[40S Reinitiation]
    AH --> AI[Rapid TC Rebinding]
    AI --> AJ[Initiates at uORF4]
    AJ --> AK[/uORF4 Blocks GCN4 Start/]
    AK --> AL[No Gcn4 Protein]
    AL --> AM([Low Gcn4])
    
    %% Starvation Conditions Translation
    V --> AN[Low TC Availability]
    AN --> AO[40S Scans from Cap]
    AO --> AP[Initiates at uORF1]
    AP --> AQ[Translates uORF1]
    AQ --> AR[40S Reinitiation]
    AR --> AS[Slow TC Rebinding]
    AS --> AT[/Scans Past uORF2-4/]
    AT --> AU[Reaches GCN4 Start Codon]
    AU --> AV[GCN4 Translation]
    AV --> AW[Gcn4 Protein Produced]
    
    %% Gcn4 Nuclear Function
    AW --> AX[Gcn4 Nuclear Import]
    AX --> AY[Gcn4 Homodimerization]
    AY --> AZ{AND: Gcn4 Dimer<br/>AND GCRE?}
    AZ -->|No| BA[No Activation]
    AZ -->|Yes| BB[Gcn4 Binds GCRE Elements]
    
    BB --> BC{OR: Which Gene<br/>Class?}
    BC -->|AA Biosynthesis| BD[HIS3/TRP3/LEU2/ARG Genes]
    BC -->|Purine Synthesis| BE[ADE Genes]
    BC -->|Autophagy| BF[ATG Genes]
    BC -->|Mitochondrial| BG[Respiratory Genes]
    BC -->|Amino Acid Permeases| BH[Permease Genes]
    
    %% Amino Acid Biosynthesis
    BD --> BI[Amino Acid Synthesis Enzymes]
    BI --> BJ[Increased AA Production]
    BJ --> BK[Amino Acid Pools Restored]
    
    %% Purine Synthesis
    BE --> BL[Purine Biosynthesis Enzymes]
    BL --> BM[Enhanced Nucleotide Synthesis]
    
    %% Autophagy
    BF --> BN[Autophagy Machinery]
    BN --> BO[/Protein Degradation/]
    BO --> BP[Amino Acid Recycling]
    BP --> BK
    
    %% Adaptation
    BK --> BQ[AA Starvation Relieved]
    BQ --> BR[Charged tRNAs Restored]
    BR --> BS[Gcn2 Inactivation]
    BS --> BT[eIF2α Dephosphorylation]
    BT --> BU[Normal Translation Resumed]
    
    %% Gcn4 Turnover
    AW --> BV[Pho85-Pcl5 CDK]
    BV --> BW[Gcn4 Phosphorylation]
    BW --> BX[SCF Ubiquitin Ligase]
    BX --> BY[/Gcn4 Degradation/]
    BY --> BZ[Short Half-life 5 min]
    BZ --> CA[/Rapid Response Termination/]
    
    BU --> CB([Homeostasis Restored])
    
